Grammar

Rule 0     S' -> start
Rule 1     start -> object
Rule 2     object -> LBRACE RBRACE
Rule 3     object -> LBRACE members RBRACE
Rule 4     members -> pair
Rule 5     members -> members COMMA pair
Rule 6     pair -> STRING COLON value
Rule 7     value -> STRING
Rule 8     value -> NUMBER
Rule 9     value -> object
Rule 10    value -> array
Rule 11    array -> LBRACKET RBRACKET
Rule 12    array -> LBRACKET elements RBRACKET
Rule 13    elements -> value
Rule 14    elements -> elements COMMA value

Terminals, with rules where they appear

COLON                : 6
COMMA                : 5 14
LBRACE               : 2 3
LBRACKET             : 11 12
NUMBER               : 8
RBRACE               : 2 3
RBRACKET             : 11 12
STRING               : 6 7
error                : 

Nonterminals, with rules where they appear

array                : 10
elements             : 12 14
members              : 3 5
object               : 1 9
pair                 : 4 5
start                : 0
value                : 6 13 14

Parsing method: LALR

